{"ID":"20240513083006-2w1d5ou","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083006-2w1d5ou","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083006-2w1d5ou\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513174057-l3n3b78\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513174057-l3n3b78\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:917,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513174057-l3n3b78\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:1357,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:1357\u0026#125;","title":"315","type":"doc","updated":"20240515115249"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513174057-l3n3b78","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 928px;","id":"20240513174057-l3n3b78","updated":"20240515115249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"228-1 P, E"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"69/胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/07"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：皮膚紅癢"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 頭身：皮癢色紅如燒灼燙傷，色紅赤。雙足溫，手溫有汗額涼。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 汗：很易出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 飲食：胃口好，口渴喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 睡眠：睡很好。晚上最癢，2點會醒來，會打鼾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 二便：大便很好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 其它：有服西藥benicar降血壓藥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"sup","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"已數年，一年多前量加倍即出現全身紅，西醫說是藥物副作用會自己消退，但結果沒消退。血糖90"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"sup","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。，五年前有攝護腺癌，PSA：1.0。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→倪師查其足溫且手皮膚不亁，故不認為他有攝護腺癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌診：黃濕。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼診：肝區黃濁有褐色的點，肝有損傷。瞳孔對光反應無"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→腎陽虛故他血壓高"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝積肥氣，腎陽不足，肝中積濕熱。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢、黃芩三錢、鬱金五錢、龍膽草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" →疏肝，清肝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青皮三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→解肝毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"連翹三錢、銀花三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→皮癢。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茜草三錢、白芍五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→除肝中瘀血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎陽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敗龜板三錢、補骨脂三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→補腎陰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"南星三錢、半夏三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→除痰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"側柏葉五錢、當歸三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→生髮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"何首烏五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→黑髮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"澤瀉五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→代腎利小便。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→預防腦血管破裂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.如果藥廠把血壓的正常值下降，那幾乎所有的人都該吃藥。我們身體需要陽的作用，陽代表你的身體功能沒有任何問題，如果你持續吃這藥，陽會受損，代表你更容易生病，更短命。所以我們必需幫你戒掉這個藥。如果我們開始治療，患者可以睡的像石頭，大便正常，沒有胸痛，腳溫，我們不會量你的血壓，你不會有心臟病。西醫說中風前沒有任何徵兆，他們錯了，中風前的四個徵兆："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1).胸悶。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2).手指前三指麻。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3).大便不規則，有時下利有時便秘。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.最近的報導，如果你嚴格控制你的血糖，你死的更快，相反的，你不嚴格控制血糖，你活的更久。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.肝區黃濁有褐色的點，肝有損傷，所以二點會醒來。你看他瞳孔的反應，這就是高血壓的原因（腎陽反應不良）。中醫可以藉由眼診來了解你內在臟腑的問題。上帝造眼睛並不止是讓你能看，也是讓我們能檢查你。腎主水，色黑，所以瞳孔是代表腎，當你瞳孔反應不良，代表你腎陽虛。陰代表你的構造，如同你可以看到手臂的粗細，但你卻無法了解它內在存有多少力量，這力量就是陽。你吸氣時氣由心肺降至腎，你呼氣氣從腎再由心肺出。當你腎陽虛時，你的腎血管會比較窄，這就是你高血壓的原因。腎主宰你的記憶，你的腦的品質，和你的骨質，如果有你一天你的頭髮回來了，你的骨頭變硬了，性功能變強，早起不會覺得疲倦，代表你的腎恢復了。瞳孔外的一圈虹膜，代表著脾和胰，我們看你這區沒有問題，所以你的食欲正常。外面的這層，是肝，如果你的功能正常，它看起來就像一片木板，你可看到非常平均的木紋，如果你失去木紋且有黃厚色的在這裡，我們稱做濕熱，如果有濕熱在你的肝，表示你的血不乾淨，因為肝就像過濾器，如果肝功能正常，它就可以過濾掉許多毒素，血中就不會有毒素物質存在，午夜一點至三點這二個鐘頭，是它的主時，所以當你肝有問題，就會在這時因某些症狀醒來。肝硬化肝癌，我們中藥有很強的解毒藥，當你吃一段時間後，紅赤色退掉，不癢，大便由黑色變棕色，表示毒素排除，肝功能完全恢復。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.患者五年前被西醫檢查出攝護腺癌，PSA:1.0，患者手掌溫潤，不會有攝護腺癌。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}